<title>BELGIUM: EU to discuss '96/97 sugar balance sheet Wednesday.</title>
<headline>EU to discuss '96/97 sugar balance sheet Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday will discuss the provisional sugar supply balance sheet for 1996/97, an EU official said.</p>
<p>It will also discuss the latest estimate of carry-over supplies into 1997/98, the official added.</p>
<p>It will examine the final 1995/96 sugar balance sheet after declining last week to release details, saying that it contained inconsistencies and needed to be recalculated.</p>
</text>
